    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46943" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sup-pătĕo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subp-</span></b> ), ēre,
			v. n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to lie open beneath</i>, <i>spread out
				beneath</i> (Appul.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quae (fovea) fruticibus imis suppatet,</span>”
				<i>was spread over at the bottom</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 8, p. 210, 28</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">campi suppatentes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 7</span></i>
			, p. 198, 31.</div>
